---
import { SITE } from '../config';
---
<section id="install" class="mx-auto max-w-[1100px] px-6 pb-28">
  <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl mb-4">Use with GPT-6 Astra</h2>
  <p class="max-w-2xl mb-8">Open this repository as a Codex project and select GPT-6 Astra. Choose a skill for the work at hand, or name it directly in your request.</p>
  <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-5">
    <div class="rounded-2xl bg-[var(--color-bg-card)] p-6 sm:p-8">
      <h3 class="text-lg mb-3">In this project</h3>
      <p class="mb-5 text-sm">Clone the repository. Codex discovers its project-local skills in <code>.agents/skills/</code>.</p>
      <code class="block text-sm break-all mb-5">git clone {SITE.github}.git</code>
      <a href={SITE.github} class="underline underline-offset-4">Open the repository &rarr;</a>
    </div>
    <div class="rounded-2xl bg-[var(--color-bg-card)] p-6 sm:p-8">
      <h3 class="text-lg mb-3">In your own project</h3>
      <p class="mb-5 text-sm">Download a skill and extract its complete folder into your project's <code>.agents/skills/</code>. Keep its references and example together. Select Astra in that project too.</p>
      <a href="/downloads/skills-all.zip" download class="inline-block rounded-full bg-[var(--color-text)] text-[var(--color-bg)] px-5 py-2.5 text-sm">Download all eight skills</a>
    </div>
  </div>
  <p class="mt-5 text-sm text-[var(--color-text-muted)]">Upgrading? Replace old installed copies to avoid duplicate skills. Storytelling, Outreach, Launch, Unblock, Weekly Review and Video Starter are now part of the eight workflows above.</p>
</section>
